    {
     "e": "⏰",
     "t": "{name} reads about Amir's daily routine. Hello, I am Amir. Every day, I wake up at 6 a.m."
    },
    {
     "e": "🪥👕",
     "t": "I brush my teeth and get dressed."
    },
    {
     "e": "🍳🏫",
     "t": "After I have breakfast, I go to school."
    },
    {
     "e": "📚⚽",
     "t": "I learn and play with my friends."
    },
    {
     "e": "🏠✏️",
     "t": "After school, I go home and do my homework."
    },
    {
     "e": "➕s",
     "t": "We use the present simple for routines. With he, she, it we add -s: He plays. She wakes up at 7 a.m."
    },
    {
     "e": "➕es",
     "t": "If the verb ends in ch, sh, x, ss or o, we add -es: he brushes, she watches, he goes."
    }
   ]
